ng=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">非常；很；相当；颇；极其；几乎；差不多；将近</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192724\">よっぽど<ruby>印象<rp>(</rp><rt>いんしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>残<rp>(</rp><rt>のこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じゃないと<ruby>覚<rp>(</rp><rt>おぼ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えてないんだよね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Unless it&#x27;s something fairly impressive, I won&#x27;t remember it.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">四つ角</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よつかど</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">四个角落；十字路口；交叉路口；街角</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">予定</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">预定；安排</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>週末<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうまつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>予定<rp>(</rp><rt>よてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまだ<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まっていません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">周末的安排还没定。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">与党</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よとう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">执