\" lang=\"en\">I fell back on the reserve tank when the gas ran out.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">呼び掛ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よびかける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">呼喊；招呼；向…讲话；呼吁；劝告；劝诫；建议</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"176369\"><ruby>警官<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすりに<ruby>対<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>注意<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>呼<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>びかけた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The policeman called attention to the problem of pickpockets.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">呼び出す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よびだす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">叫来；传唤；召唤；打电话叫；呼叫（如呼叫服务）；唤起（如唤起精灵）；调用；打开；启动</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201251\">どうぞ<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>電話口<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわぐち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>呼<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>び<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Please call him to the telephone.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">呼び止める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よびとめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">叫住；拦住；招停（如出租车）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"176085\"><ruby>警察官<rp>(</rp><rt>けいさつかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>呼<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>び<ruby>止<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>時速<rp>(</rp><rt>じそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>１２０キロで<ruby>走<rp>(</rp><rt>はし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I was going 120 kilometers an hour when the police stopped me.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夜更かし</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よふかし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">熬夜；晚睡</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"99464\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>夜更<rp>(</rp><rt>よふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かしをするようになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He fell into the habit of keeping late hours.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夜更け</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よふけ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">夜深；深夜；凌晨</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"185513\"><ruby>我々<rp>(</rp><rt>われわれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>夜更<rp>(</rp><rt>よふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けまで<ruby>語<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">We talked late into the night.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">呼ぶ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よぶ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-lev